ruses. Jones, on the other hand, has claimed that he had not meant to cause damage. In his words, it was all an \"unfortunate accident\"."}, {"time": "57500", "image": "engenn8le03ob03re2img03.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "The case was brought before the U.S. Supreme Court, which decided that computer criminals should be punished if they caused damage, intentionally or unintentionally. The new laws have been causing \"computer geniuses\" to think twice before they create and spread viruses."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}